286 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Iglupark is an aparthotel in Lennusadam Seaplane Harbour\054 Tallinn\054 run by Iglucraft\054 a well\055known producer of saunas and cabins\056 Iglupark offers a unique experience to spend some quality time in the most vibrant area of Tallinn\056\nMy task was to design a website that goes in line with the main Iglucraft website but still maintaining visual distinction of its own\056 \nPlayful and earthy\054 Iglupark website conveys the idea of both closeness to nature and vibrant city life\056    )
